          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ethiopic script font designed in a handwritten style.\n\nThe Geʾez Handwriting Out Arrows typeface is an implementation of a handwritten style as would be produced by a pen or pencil. \n\nThe Geʾez Handwriting Out Arrows regular typeface applies directional arrows to the \"Geʾez Handwriting Outlines\" style to indicate stroke direction.\n\nProject Homepage: https://github.com/raeytype/geez-handwriting-fonts"
